task_spec.prompt:
Extend src/app.py with three new endpoints backed by an in-memory dict store.

Store: items: dict[int, dict] = {}; next_id: int = 1  (module-level or app.state)

POST /items
  Body: {"name": str}
  Creates item {"id": <next_id>, "name": <name>}, stores it, returns it with status 201.

GET /items/{item_id}
  Returns {"id": item_id, "name": <name>} or 404 if not found.

DELETE /items/{item_id}
  Removes item, returns 204 No Content. Returns 404 if not found.

Also update GET /items to return all stored items: {"items": [<item>, ...]}
The original test (response == {"items": []}) must still pass on a fresh state.

Add tests/test_crud.py covering the new endpoints.
